{%- doc -%}
  Returns the customer-facing default sell price for one variant.

  Default price is always the Shopify variant (standard) price.
  Express is never used to undercut the displayed price:
    - express_price > base  → paid upgrade; show base (shopper can upgrade)
    - express_price == base → same-price express; show base
    - express_price < base  → corrupt / leftover metafield; ignore, show base
    - express_available false/null → ignore express_price entirely

  Cart Transform still applies the chosen delivery price at add-to-cart time.
  This snippet is display-only (PLP, PDP, schema, cards).

  @param {variant} variant
{%- enddoc -%}

{%- liquid
  assign effective_price = variant.price
-%}
{{- effective_price -}}
